 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey there, how are you?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hey. Random question. Why do my doors swing open on their own?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.26,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Usually the door isn't hanging quite straight, so gravity pulls it. Older houses with sloping floors do this a lot.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ours is from the twenties, so yeah, sloping everything.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A simple trick is to take one hinge pin out and give it a very slight bend. It adds friction so the door stays where you leave it.",
   "est_sec": 8.78,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Bend it? With what?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.9,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Rest it on something hard and tap the middle with a hammer, just a tiny bit. Then slide it back in.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That sounds like the kind of fix my granddad would do.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 2.28,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It is an old school trick, and it works well. Do one door first and see how you like it.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg29"
  }
 ]
}
